var draft = "It writes this chat's own world unless in says document: staged with your turn like any change, and played at once (your next call sees it, and everyone's once you commit), it goes with the turn if the turn is undone, and world_keep copies it into the world's document for other chats. With in: document it writes the world's draft instead, which this chat plays only after world_commit and then world_upgrade; the answer then says the draft's version and the problems the write brought (world_status lists them all).";
